Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.20,0:09:48.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道你对阿富汗了解多少{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know how much you know about Afghanistan
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.20,0:09:51.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,很多人在地图上甚至都找不到它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Most people can't even find it on a map
