Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.24,0:10:23.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,阿富汗军队己有了毒刺导弹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Afghan Forces are now getting shipment of stinger missiles
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.31,0:10:26.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,并固守根据地进行反抗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're beginning to hold their own against air strikes
