Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.36,0:10:36.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,就如照片上显示一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As those photos indicate
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.75,0:10:40.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,他切断所有外援{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's managed to strangle off all aid from the outside
