Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.76,0:11:25.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,看来我们白跑一趟了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like we got a long walk down those stairs
