Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.32,0:11:48.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,这个任务很重要  约翰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This mission's important,John
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.32,0:11:50.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,你真的认为我们可改变什么吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you really think we'll make a difference?
