Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.34,0:12:10.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢住这里  喜欢在这里工作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like being here, I like working here
