Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.59,0:12:13.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,你确有归属{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You do belong to something
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.76,0:12:16.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,但不是这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not this
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.35,0:12:18.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,你何时才能成为完人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When will you come full circle?
