Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.36,0:12:29.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,我知你为何来此  约翰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know the reasons you're here,John
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.36,0:12:31.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,但这样不是办法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it doesn't work that way
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.37,0:12:32.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,你可以尝试别样的生活{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You may try,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.81,0:12:34.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,但你无法逃避真正的你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but you can't get away what you really are
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.37,0:12:36.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,你认为真正的我是什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.37,0:12:38.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,一个浴血战场的军人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A full-blooded combat soldier
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.37,0:12:41.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,不再是了  我不要这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not anymore. I don't want it
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.38,0:12:43.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,太可惜了  因为你注定是这种人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's too bad because you're stuck with it
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.38,0:12:45.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,我给你讲个故事  约翰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me tell you a story,John
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.38,0:12:48.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,有个雕刻家  他发现了块石头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was a sculptor,and he found a stone
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.38,0:12:50.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,很特别的石头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a special stone
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.39,0:12:52.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,他把它拖回家  努力多月{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He dragged it home,worked on it for months,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.39,0:12:54.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,终于完成了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}until he finally finished it
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.39,0:12:56.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,他给他朋友看这石头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When he was ready to show it to his friends
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.39,0:12:59.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们说他创造了一件杰出的雕像{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They said he'd created a great statue
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.39,0:13:01.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,雕刻家说他没创造出什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The sculptor said he hadn't created anything
