Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.40,0:13:07.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,他只是把多余部份清除掉而己{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He just cleared away the small pieces
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.40,0:13:10.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们不是要将你训练成战争机器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We didn't' make you this fighting machine
