Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.98,0:22:49.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,你可知道  你是首个在阿富汗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you realize,you're the first American
