Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.04,0:23:43.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,我在这己无甚可做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is little more I can do here
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.76,0:23:47.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,就像你们所说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is as you say
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.04,0:23:49.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,己没有了挑战性{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Without challenges
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.05,0:23:53.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果你能告诉我关于{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you supply to me worthy information
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.01,0:23:56.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,你们导弹供应计划的情报{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}about more stinger missiles you are planning to deliver
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.05,0:23:59.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,这对你我二人都有好处{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it could provide a way out of this for us both
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.06,0:24:04.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟  大家最终想要的都是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After all,in the end,what everyone really wants is...
