Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.06,0:24:11.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,俄政府还真幽默{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Kremlin's got a sense of humor
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.07,0:24:13.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,为什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}PIease explain
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.07,0:24:16.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,你们向世界宣扬和平  军备裁减{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You talk peace and disarmament to the world
