Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.56,0:24:27.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,相信那些荒谬宣传{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to believe such absurd propaganda
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.08,0:24:30.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,再问一次  导弹在哪里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now again,where are the missiles?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.09,0:24:32.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,我对导弹的事一概不知{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know anything about any missiles
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.09,0:24:35.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,你当然知道  但你似乎不了解{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course you do. But you don't seem to realize
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.09,0:24:37.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,我正为你我二人寻找出路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm providing a way out for us both.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.09,0:24:39.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,你在寻求同情吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You expect sympathy?
