Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.10,0:24:46.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,全面胜利只是迟早问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just a matter of time before we achieve a complete victory
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.76,0:24:48.09,*Default,,0,0,0,,根本不会有胜利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There won't be a victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.10,0:24:51.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,你们的战争机器每天都输给{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every day your war machines lose ground to a bunch of
