Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.11,0:24:57.10,*Default,,0,0,0,,事实上  你低估了对手实力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The fact is you underestimated your competition
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.11,0:24:58.10,*Default,,0,0,0,,你若读过历史{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you studied the history,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.11,0:25:01.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,便知这些人从不屈服{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you will know these people have never given up to anyone
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.12,0:25:03.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们宁死  也不愿成奴隶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They'd rather die,than be slaves
