Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.12,0:25:07.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,你打不倒这样的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't defeat a people like that
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.12,0:25:11.12,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们试过了  在越南已试过了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We tried,We already had our Vietnam
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.13,0:25:13.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,现在轮到你们了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you're going to have yours
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.56,0:25:19.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,你要考验我  好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So,you wish to test me!Good
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.17,0:25:59.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,这就是阿富汗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Afghanistan
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.17,0:26:02.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,亚历山大大帝曾尝试征服这片国土{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alexander The Great tried to conquer this country
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.18,0:26:05.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,之后是成吉思汗  英国人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then Genghis Khan,then the British
