Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.19,0:26:16.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,你想听吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wish to hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.19,0:26:19.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,好  是这样的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very good. It says:
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.19,0:26:22.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,愿神让我们远离眼镜蛇之毒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May God deliver us from the venom of the cobra
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.20,0:26:26.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,老虎之齿  和阿富汗人的复仇之心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Teeth of the tiger And the vengeance of the Afghan
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.20,0:26:30.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,明白它的含义吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You understand what this means?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.21,0:26:33.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,你们绝对不会屈服?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That you guys don't take any shit?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.21,0:26:36.48,*Default,,0,0,0,,没错  差不多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. Something like this
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.22,0:26:44.48,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We go now
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.76,0:27:18.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,北方有很多山洞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To the north,there are many caves,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.73,0:27:20.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们由那里走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will travel through them,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.76,0:27:24.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,那样安全点  走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'll be safer,We go
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.77,0:27:30.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,这些山洞通往五狮村{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These caves lead us to the valley of five lions
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.77,0:27:32.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,古时  有人要求阿富汗国王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In ancient days,the Afghan king was asked
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.74,0:27:35.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,出兵五百{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to send 500 warriors into battle
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.77,0:27:39.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,他说  只出兵五名{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He said:Only five
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.78,0:27:43.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,那是精兵中的精兵  结果凯旋而归{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His greatest five and they won
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.78,0:27:47.65,*Default,,0,0,0,,他说  宁派五头狮子  莫派五百绵羊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He said: It's better to send five lions than 500 sheep
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.66,0:27:48.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.79,0:27:49.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,我认为国王很走运{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think the king was lucky
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.79,0:27:52.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,走运哈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lucky?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.79,0:27:54.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,还要多久才到村庄{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How much longer to the village?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.26,0:27:56.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,约两小时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About two hours
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.31,0:28:12.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,导弹要运到哪里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where in my sector are the missiles being delivered?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.31,0:28:16.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.82,0:28:19.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,你说谎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a liar
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.82,0:28:23.09,*Default,,0,0,0,,哪里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.83,0:28:27.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,哪里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.96,0:28:30.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,好  我说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. I tell you
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.53,0:28:35.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,我就知道你说谎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew you were lying
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.53,0:28:40.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,现在告诉我  导弹在哪里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now,where are the missiles located?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.54,0:28:42.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,很近{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Close
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.54,0:28:46.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,多近{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How close?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.54,0:28:48.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,近在你屁眼里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In your ass
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.36,0:29:03.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,你考验我的耐性己够久了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've tried my patience long enough
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.37,0:29:13.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,我也想客气一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I tried to be civilized
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.40,0:29:47.66,*Default,,0,0,0,,约翰·蓝波{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The name of John Rambo
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.41,0:29:53.45,*Default,,0,0,0,,你认识吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know it?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.15,0:29:56.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,不认识吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.42,0:30:01.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,他说  有人在叛军协助下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He says there are plans for a rescue attempt
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.42,0:30:03.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,打算劫狱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with the help of some rebels
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.42,0:30:07.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,他还说知道这人的去向{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He also says he knows where this man is going
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.43,0:30:13.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们会好好招待他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will welcome him
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.45,0:30:33.44,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是山谷中最后一个村庄{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the last village in the valley
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.45,0:30:36.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,大约有一百人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About 100 men here
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.46,0:30:38.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,这里有很多小孩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They have a lot of kids here
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.42,0:30:41.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,对  他们也都是出色的战士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. And they are good fighters,too
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.46,0:30:44.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,我去跟首领说我们要谈谈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I tell the leaders we want to talk
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.47,0:30:53.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们从未见过像你这样的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They never see man look like you
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.48,0:31:02.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们是默斯汀的骑士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These are Mujahedeen horsemen
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.48,0:31:05.44,*Default,,0,0,0,,边界还有一万骑士在等候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There're 10000 horsemen more waiting at the border
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.45,0:31:06.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们在等着拿武器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are waiting to get weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.26,0:31:09.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,一旦到手  就回来战斗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When they get it,they come back here to fight
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.51,0:31:29.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们去医院吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go to the hospital
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.51,0:31:37.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,他是方圆五百里内唯一的医生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's the only doctor for 500 kilometers
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.52,0:31:43.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们两个月内第一次拿到药品{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The first medicine they get in two months
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.53,0:31:54.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,俄军送来很多礼物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More gifts from the Soviets
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.53,0:31:56.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,看来像玩具  但其实是地雷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They look like toys,but they are mines
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.53,0:31:59.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们教导孩子别去碰  但有时已太迟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We teach children not to touch,Some learn too late
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.54,0:32:05.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,那是谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.54,0:32:07.54,*Default,,0,0,0,,他叫约里  是俄国人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His name is Uri. He's Russian
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.55,0:32:08.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,逃兵吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deserter?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.26,0:32:10.54,*Default,,0,0,0,,他自称投降者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He call himself a Defector
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.55,0:32:12.54,*Default,,0,0,0,,这有很多他这样的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are many like him
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.55,0:32:14.54,*Default,,0,0,0,,他能帮很多忙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's the one who can help the most
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.55,0:32:16.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,他知道堡内的情况{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He knows the inside of the fort
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.56,0:32:22.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,我想我们该走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we should go now
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.58,0:32:43.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,地雷从这里开始{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mine starts here
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.58,0:32:45.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,像这样一米{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At 1 meter like this
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.58,0:32:49.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,然后像这样有二米{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then go 2 meters like this and like this
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.59,0:32:52.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,有四个塔台  四个哨兵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They have four towers,Four guards
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.59,0:32:56.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,这里  这里  这里和这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here,here,here and here
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.59,0:32:58.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,犯人关在哪里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where they keep the prisoners?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.60,0:32:59.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.26,0:33:04.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,进去后  有其他出口吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we get in there,is there another way out?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.26,0:33:07.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,地下  满是臭水的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Underground,where is all bad water
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.61,0:33:09.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道那该叫作什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do not know words for this place
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.61,0:33:11.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,他是说污水道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He means sewer
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.76,0:33:12.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,在哪里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.61,0:33:15.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,这里  通到外面的那边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here,Outside,it goes there
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.61,0:33:17.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,有哨兵巡逻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guards patrol there
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.62,0:33:20.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,我认为你不该走这条路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do not think you go this way
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.62,0:33:23.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,那我们走雷区  他们不会巡逻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We should go through the mine fields,They will not expect it
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.62,0:33:27.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,不行  那里有很多地雷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This cannot be done .There are many spetnaz commandos
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.63,0:33:29.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们只剩下这些人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are only these
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.63,0:33:31.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们损失了很多人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have lost many men
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.63,0:33:34.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果再去  会损失更多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We lose many more if we go there
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.63,0:33:36.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不需很多人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't need many men
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.63,0:33:39.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,你打算怎么做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it that you want to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.64,0:33:41.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,我需要两人带我穿过雷区{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need two men to get me into the mine field
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.64,0:33:43.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,两人协助我逃走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And two to help me to escape
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.64,0:33:44.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,这样做的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If this is done
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.64,0:33:46.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,俄军会像从前一样来这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Soviets will come here like before
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.64,0:33:49.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,会死更多人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And more peopIe will die
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.65,0:33:50.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,我等不了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't wait
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.65,0:33:53.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,你要像我们一样等待救援{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must wait for help,the way we wait
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.65,0:33:56.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,那我一个人去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I'll go alone
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.95,0:33:58.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,你会死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you will die
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.66,0:34:04.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,那就死吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I die
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.66,0:34:10.65,*Default,,0,0,0,,等等{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.66,0:34:12.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,请你别去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.67,0:34:22.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,我名叫拉苏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name is Masoud
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.68,0:34:24.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,在了解我们为何不能帮你前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must not judge us
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.65,0:34:27.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,请别对我们妄下判断{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before you understand why we are not ready to help
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.68,0:34:32.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,大部分阿富汗人都很坚强{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Most of the Afghan people are very strong
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.69,0:34:36.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们决意不能被逐离自己的土地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we are determined not to be driven from our land
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.69,0:34:40.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们的孩子病死  炸死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our children die of disease,mines
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.26,0:34:42.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,给毒气毒死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and poison gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.26,0:34:45.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,妇女惨遭奸杀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the women are raped and killed
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.70,0:34:49.70,*Default,,0,0,0,,去年  邻谷的依拉洛格曼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last year,in the valley of Laghman,the next valley,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.71,0:34:52.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,6千阿富汗人被杀害{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}6000 Afghans were killed
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.71,0:34:57.66,*Default,,0,0,0,,怀孕妇女被破肚开肠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pregnant women were cut with bayonets
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.67,0:35:00.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,婴孩被丢入火中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and their babies thrown into the fires
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.71,0:35:01.70,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们这样做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is done,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.71,0:35:05.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,是为了斩草除根{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so they will not have to fight the next generation of Afghans
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.72,0:35:09.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,但报章杂志不会有任何报导{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yet nobody sees anything or reads anything in the papers
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.72,0:35:12.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,你现在所见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you see here
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.69,0:35:15.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,是默斯汀战士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}are the Mujahedeens soldiers
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.36,0:35:18.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,神圣的战士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holy warriors
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.36,0:35:21.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,对我们而言  这是场圣战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To us,this war is a Holy war
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.74,0:35:23.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,默斯汀战士是打不死的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And there's no true death for a Mujahedeen
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.74,0:35:26.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,因为我们己发过毒誓{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because we have taken our last rites
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.74,0:35:30.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,视死如归{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We consider ourselves dead already
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.74,0:35:34.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,于我们  为土地和神灵而忘是荣誉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To us, death for our land and God is an honor
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.75,0:35:37.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,所以  朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So,my friend
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.75,0:35:38.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们所要做的是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What we must do
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.72,0:35:43.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,保护我们的妻儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is to stop this killing of our women and children
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.76,0:35:46.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,若能救出那人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If getting this man free,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.73,0:35:48.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,让他回到自由世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so he can return to the free world
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.76,0:35:52.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,告诉别人这里发生的事情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and tell what happens here is necessary
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.77,0:35:55.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们当然会帮忙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then of course,we will heIp
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.77,0:35:58.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,离开吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave us now
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.77,0:36:01.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,让我们自己商量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So we may speak among ourseIves
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.74,0:36:04.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,救出那人的最佳方法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and find the best way to free this man
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.78,0:36:11.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.79,0:36:13.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们感谢你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.81,0:36:39.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,放心  他们很快会有决定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry.They will decide soon
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.96,0:36:41.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,今晚必须进去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got to get in tonight
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.76,0:36:43.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,你叫什么名字{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.26,0:36:47.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,这小孩非常坚强{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This boy is very hard inside
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.82,0:36:51.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,他父母去年被杀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His parents were killed last year
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.83,0:36:54.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,他哥哥死在那美国人被关押的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His brother died in the fort where the American is
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.83,0:36:57.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,他虽是小孩  却如男子汉般战斗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He looks like a boy,but he fights like a man
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.83,0:36:59.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,你叫什么名字{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.83,0:37:01.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,蓝波{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rambo
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.54,0:37:02.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,你从哪里来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you from?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.84,0:37:04.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,亚历桑纳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arizona
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.84,0:37:07.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,亚历桑纳?  要走几天路?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arizona?How much days' walk?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.84,0:37:11.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,约两年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About two years
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.85,0:37:13.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,你是军人吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you a soldier?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.85,0:37:15.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,曾经是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No more
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.85,0:37:18.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,我是军人  你准备好战斗了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am a soldier.Are you ready to fight?
