Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.39,1:35:35.65,*Default,,0,0,0,,我必需走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got to go
Dialogue: 0,1:35:59.42,1:36:03.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,再见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goodbye
Dialogue: 0,1:36:09.43,1:36:11.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,难以置信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hard to believe,John
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.43,1:36:13.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了  长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that,sir?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:13.43,1:36:14.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,我很不愿承认  但老实说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hate to admit it,but the truth is,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.44,1:36:18.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得我们开始害怕了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we're getting soft
